IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Part VIIA of the Interpretation Act 1978 (Northern Territory): Incorporation of amendments, sections 72A to 72D.
-- Reprint as in force at 21 April 2023.
--
-- A function answers JUST TRUE or JUST FALSE where the text itself says yes or no, and NOTHING where it does not.

§ `Section 72A: meaning of reprint`

DECLARE `Kind of thing that may be reprinted` IS ONE OF
    `an Act that may be reprinted`
    `subordinate legislation that may be reprinted`
    `something else that may be reprinted`

-- In this Part, legislation means an Act or subordinate legislation.
-- src:881 | legislation means an Act or subordinate legislation.
@ref s 72A "legislation" (src:881)
GIVEN thing IS A `Kind of thing that may be reprinted`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72A "legislation": the thing is legislation` MEANS
    CONSIDER thing
    WHEN `an Act that may be reprinted` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `subordinate legislation that may be reprinted` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `something else that may be reprinted` THEN JUST FALSE

-- Reprint, of legislation, means a consolidated copy of the legislation published by the Government Printer.
-- src:882 | reprint, of legislation, means a consolidated copy of the legislation published by the Government Printer.
@ref s 72A "reprint" (src:882)
GIVEN `it is a consolidated copy of the legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is published by the Government Printer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72A "reprint": the document is a reprint of the legislation` MEANS
    JUST (`it is a consolidated copy of the legislation` AND `it is published by the Government Printer`)

§ `Section 72B: reprint of legislation in force at a stated date`

-- A reprint must show the legislation as in force at the date stated in the reprint.
-- src:884 | (1) A reprint of legislation must show the legislation as in force at the date stated in the reprint.
@ref s 72B(1) (src:884)
GIVEN `the day on which the amendment commences` IS A DATE
      `the date stated in the reprint` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72B(1): the reprint must show the amendment as in force` MEANS
    JUST (Day `the day on which the amendment commences` AT MOST Day `the date stated in the reprint`)

-- An amendment that commences after the date of the reprint is not included in the reprint, but subsection (2) does not prevent the inclusion of an uncommenced amendment that is identified as uncommenced.
-- src:885 | (2) For the avoidance of doubt, an amendment of legislation that commences after the date of the reprint is not included in the reprint.
-- src:886 | (3) Subsection (2) does not prevent the inclusion of uncommenced amendments in a reprint that are identified as uncommenced.
@ref s 72B(2), (3) (src:885-886)
GIVEN `the day on which the amendment commences` IS A DATE
      `the date stated in the reprint` IS A DATE
      `the reprint identifies the amendment as uncommenced` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72B(2), (3): the reprint may include the amendment` MEANS
    IF   Day `the day on which the amendment commences` AT MOST Day `the date stated in the reprint`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST `the reprint identifies the amendment as uncommenced`

§ `Sections 72C and 72D: what a reprint omits and includes`

DECLARE `Item that may appear in the text of legislation` IS ONE OF
    `the words of making the legislation`
    `the date of the making of the legislation`
    `the signature of the person making the legislation`
    `another item`

-- A reprint must be published without the words of making, the date of the making, or the signature of the person making the legislation.
-- src:888 | A reprint of legislation must be published without the inclusion of:
-- src:889 | (a) the words of making the legislation; or
-- src:890 | (b) the date of the making of the legislation; or
-- src:891 | (c) the signature of the person making the legislation.
@ref s 72C (src:888-891)
GIVEN item IS A `Item that may appear in the text of legislation`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72C: the reprint may include the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER item
    WHEN `another item` THEN NOTHING
    OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- A reprint must include a table of amendments listing each amending Act or instrument that has amended the legislation.
-- src:893 | A reprint of legislation must include a table of amendments listing:
-- src:894 | (a) each amending Act or other instrument that has amended that legislation; and
@ref s 72D(a) (src:893-894)
GIVEN `the amending Acts and instruments that have amended the legislation` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `the amending Acts and instruments listed in the table` IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72D(a): the table of amendments lists each amending Act or instrument` MEANS
    JUST (all (GIVEN amending YIELD any (GIVEN listed YIELD listed EQUALS amending) `the amending Acts and instruments listed in the table`) `the amending Acts and instruments that have amended the legislation`)

-- The table must also list each provision that has been amended, with a reference to the amending Act or instrument.
-- src:893 | A reprint of legislation must include a table of amendments listing:
-- src:894 | (a) each amending Act or other instrument that has amended that legislation; and
-- src:895 | (b) each provision of that legislation that has been amended and a reference to the amending Act or instrument that made the amendment.
@ref s 72D(b) (src:893-895)
GIVEN `the provisions of the legislation that have been amended` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `the amended provisions listed in the table with a reference to the amending Act or instrument` IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 72D(b): the table of amendments lists each provision that has been amended` MEANS
    JUST (all (GIVEN amended YIELD any (GIVEN listed YIELD listed EQUALS amended) `the amended provisions listed in the table with a reference to the amending Act or instrument`) `the provisions of the legislation that have been amended`)
